      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **not held by the Hub process itself**. Instead, a local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and **injects it directly into the environment of the spawned child process** (Ingest or Query agent) immediately before that process starts. The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated, so the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually needs to call the Anthropic API. This prevents a compromised Hub process from leaking the credential by inspecting environment variables.",
